<% pageTitle = 'Cancellation Policy' %>
<%- include('partials/header') %>
<section class="section">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:760px;">
    <h2>Cancellation Policy</h2>
    <p>You can cancel your order any time before the advance payment is made, free of charge.</p>
    <p>After the advance payment is received but before our artist has started work on your piece, you may still cancel — the advance is refunded minus any payment gateway charges already incurred.</p>
    <p>Once production has started (the artist has begun drawing or painting your portrait), the order can no longer be cancelled, since the materials and time invested are specific to your artwork and cannot be resold.</p>
    <p>To request a cancellation, please contact us as soon as possible via <a href="/contact">Contact</a> or WhatsApp with your Order ID, and we'll confirm whether your order still qualifies.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
